cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "WW3 GPU Lab: hands-on WAVEWATCH III modelling and a C++/Kokkos GPU port"
abstract: >-
  A self-paced course and toolkit for the WAVEWATCH III spectral wind-wave model:
  build and run the Fortran model on real cases, benchmark it, and port its kernels
  (starting with the W3SNL1 nonlinear interaction source term) to C++/Kokkos with a
  numerical parity harness against the Fortran reference.
authors:
  - given-names: "Matheus Hoffmann Fernandes"
    family-names: "Santos"
    affiliation: "Escola Politécnica, Universidade Federal do Rio de Janeiro"
repository-code: "https://github.com/h0ffmann/ww3-gpu"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - WAVEWATCH III
  - ocean waves
  - spectral wave model
  - GPU
  - Kokkos
  - Fortran
  - high-performance computing
